<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche seen launching $1 bln convertible.</title>
<headline>Roche seen launching $1 bln convertible.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG, the Swiss pharamceuticals concern, is currently preparing to launch a $1 billion U.S. convertible bond, traders in Switzerland said.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch is believed to be leading the issue.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
